f real-time communication severely limited the ability to disseminate vital health updates, public service messages, and emergency alerts to patients and visitors—undermining the original vision behind deploying these displays. Our Solution Pro Digital engineered a future-ready, scalable solution by introducing its industrial-grade Pro Digital Signage Player , a plug-and-play device designed to work with all makes and models of existing TVs at the healthcare centres. Instead of replacing hardware, we retrofitted the current systems to create a centralized, CMS-powered digital signage network that could: Schedule and broadcast multimedia health content Instantly push emergency notifications or public awareness campaigns Operate seamlessly across various TV brands and display formats Eliminate the need for manual USB content updates Enable remote monitoring and health analytics of each unit Each signage player was pre-configured with Pro Digital’s proprietary CMS , ensuring robust performance, multi-format compatibility, and secure, encrypted content delivery. Our Scope Included Pro Digital took complete ownership of the end-to-end retrofit deployment. This included technical audit of all existing TVs, supply and installation of signage players, cloud-based CMS setup, UI/UX configuration for ease of content management, and comprehensive training for BBMP staff. Our team also provided operational support for content creation, health data visual templates, and long-term SLA-based maintenance. The Impact 100% Centralized Control of all healthcare centre displays through one cloud CMS Zero Downtime in content broadcasting across hundreds of endpoints Real-time Emergency Updates delivered instantly across all connected locations Reduced Operational Load, eliminating manual updates and human errors Improved Health Communication , with timely visuals on hygiene, vaccination, and public health advisories This project dramatically improved patient engagement, enhanced healthcare communication, and ensured compliance with public outreach mandates at scale. Why It Matters This deployment is a model example of how existing infrastructure can be digitally transformed without expensive hardware overhaul. By solving a deeply functional challenge with a cost-effective and scalable retrofit, Pro Digital enabled the Government of Karnataka to fulfil its vision of connected healthcare communication. The same approach can be replicated across public institutions—from transport hubs to educational campuses—where budget constraints meet the need for smart digital transformation. Read Department of Mines & Geology, Karnataka: iStandee Deployment Across Districts This is some text inside of a div block. Read BBMP Hospitals, Government of Karnataka | Digital Signage Upgrade for Public Healthcare Centres This is some text inside of a div block. Read Indian Navy, Futuristic Training Centre This is some text inside of a div block. .white-grid {
