nge of Pro Digital’s hardware and software tools. The suite can include: Transparent OLED kiosks for live alerts, maps, and real-time status panels Large interactive touch tables for collaborative planning and multi-operator control Gen AI-backed dashboards with voice and gesture navigation Flexible LED walls that adapt to the operational context Everything is designed to function as one cohesive system, creating an intelligent, responsive, and immersive control room experience. Key Features of ProNerve Supports management of over 100 live systems, feeds, and data sources Seamless integration with command center software and server infrastructure AI-powered source selection, filtering, and LED wall orchestration Operator consoles with multi-touch surfaces and personalized control layouts Natural language input and voice control via HoloBox integration Modular design adaptable to small teams or multi-tiered control rooms Compatible with transparent OLEDs, touch tables, and interactive dashboards Built to ISO 11064 ergonomic and spatial planning standards On-premise Gen AI deployment with organization-specific training and total data control Always Learning. Always Adapting. ProNerve is not a static system. With every interaction, its Gen AI core learns how your team works, what matters most, and how to anticipate needs before they arise. Over time, it begins suggesting screen layouts, recommending focus sources, and optimizing workflows based on real operator behavior. Ideal for High-Impact Operations ProNerve is built for organizations that cannot afford to miss a beat. Ideal use cases include: Smart City Integrated Command Centres Emergency Operations and Disaster Management National Infrastructure Control Hubs Aerospace and Defense War Rooms Industrial Automation and Utility Grids Corporate Experience Centres with Live Operational Demos Why Choose ProNerve Combines hardware, software, and AI in one complete solution Custom built to your location, workflow, and data architecture Interoperable with legacy systems and future-ready technologies Delivered with full turnkey support including design, integration, and training Built in-house by Pro Digital with a deep focus on real-world control room needs Enterprise-grade security with private AI deployment and no external data access With ProNerve, your command center becomes more than a space. It becomes an intelligent ecosystem that reacts, learns, and supports better decisions every moment. From mission-critical alerts to deep-dive analysis, ProNerve helps your team see more, know more, and act faster with confidence. .white-grid {
